'''Unicycle Cat''' (イチリンリン Ichi Rin Rin) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Unicycle Cat
|image = E 134.png
|first appearance = [[Hell on 3 Wheels (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Awakened Carnival III (Deadly)]]
|money drop = 1,200¢ - 4,740¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has area attack and moderate attack speed. However, he has low health and moderate attack power. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and especially [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] will do quite well against him.

